Package: com.samcejko.shutter
Name: Shutter
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Unofficial photo, video and chat client for iOS 6 (universal), in English and Czech: sign in with your account, home feed, stories, reels, profiles, likes, comments and direct messages. Private build, not for redistribution.
Maintainer: samcejko
Author: samcejko
Section: Social
Depends: firmware (>= 6.0), firmware (<< 11.0)
